//! Screen-space UI: the top status bar, the bottom-left command tray (the selected unit's stats
//! and actions, or the open city's economy and build options), tooltips for every button, and
//! an info box for a hovered unit.
//!
//! Each frame the UI is laid out once into panels, text and buttons (a `UiLayout`), which is then
//! either drawn or hit-tested against a click, so what's clickable always matches what's shown.
//! UI geometry is in pixels with the origin at the window's bottom-left and Y pointing up, the
//! same orientation as the world.

